<view class="page resources-page"><view class="page-intro"><text class="page-heading">知识，随时翻阅</text><text class="page-caption">把重要的知识，装进随身的资料库。</text></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="skeleton-stack"><view class="skeleton skeleton-row"></view><view class="skeleton skeleton-row"></view></view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="empty-state surface-card"><text class="empty-title">资料暂时无法加载</text><text class="empty-copy">{{error}}</text><ui-button label="重新加载" size="small" bind:activate="retry"/></view><block wx:else><text class="library-caption">已授权资料 · {{materials.length}} 份</text><button wx:for="{{materials}}" wx:key="id" class="resource" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openMaterial" disabled="{{!!openingId}}"><view class="file-icon"><image src="/assets/icons/ui-file.svg"/></view><view class="resource-main"><text class="resource-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="resource-copy">{{item.typeLabel}} · {{item.sizeLabel}}{{openingId === item.id ? ' · 正在打开…' : ''}}</text></view><image class="row-arrow" src="/assets/icons/ui-right.svg"/></button><view wx:if="{{!materials.length}}" class="empty-state surface-card"><text class="empty-title">还没有可阅读的电子资料</text><text class="empty-copy">已兑换课程的 PDF、Word 资料发布后会显示在这里。网页课程内的教材与练习仍可从互动学习进入。</text><ui-button label="浏览互动课程" variant="secondary" size="small" bind:activate="goCourses"/></view></block><text wx:if="{{openError}}" class="open-error">{{openError}}</text></view>
